* FD-10  Supply rejection
* Spec 3.1.3.3, Fig. 31: the FD-01 network with its inputs at VCOM and an AC
* source on the supply.  Copy P: AC 1 on VDD; copy N: AC 1 on VSS.  The
* supply-to-output-CM transfer is what the spec observes (PSRR_cm); the
* supply-to-DM transfer (PSRR_dm) is zero for a symmetric design.
{{SEED_OPTION}}
.lib "{{MODEL_LIB}}" {{CORNER}}
{{MC_PARAM}}
.include "{{DUT_FILE}}"
.temp {{TEMP}}
.options reltol=1e-6 abstol=1e-16 vntol=1e-10
VDD vdd 0 {{VDD}}
VSS vss 0 0
VCM vcm 0 {{VCM}}
* Copy P
VDDP vddp 0 DC {{VDD}} AC 1
IBIASP vddp ibiasp {{IBIAS}}
R1P vcm inpp {{R_NET}}
R2P inpp onp {{R_NET}}
R3P vcm innp {{R_NET}}
R4P innp opp {{R_NET}}
XP vss ibiasp vddp vcmpin_p inpp innp opp onp {{DUT}}
RVCM_P vcm vcmpin_p 1k
RLPP opp vcm {{RL}}
CLPP opp 0 {{CL}}
RLNP onp vcm {{RL}}
CLNP onp 0 {{CL}}
* Copy N
VSSN vssn 0 DC 0 AC 1
IBIASN vdd ibiasn {{IBIAS}}
R1N vcm inpn {{R_NET}}
R2N inpn onn {{R_NET}}
R3N vcm innn {{R_NET}}
R4N innn opn {{R_NET}}
XN vssn ibiasn vdd vcmpin_n inpn innn opn onn {{DUT}}
RVCM_N vcm vcmpin_n 1k
RLPN opn vcm {{RL}}
CLPN opn 0 {{CL}}
RLNN onn vcm {{RL}}
CLNN onn 0 {{CL}}
.control
set filetype=ascii
ac dec 50 10m 1G
write {{RAW}} v(opp) v(onp) v(opn) v(onn)
.endc
.end
